// The widget library of box, the script module box.widgets. A scene writes `using box.widgets`
// and instantiates the templates. A headless template (HeadlessButton) owns the state and input
// handling; the styled template (Button : HeadlessButton) inherits it and only draws.
//
// A widget with a value has `prop value`, the initial value, and `mut current`, the value now. A
// change by the user assigns current and calls ui.changed(this), which a scene awaits (on.change).

module box.widgets

include theme
include label
include button
include toggle
include radio
include slider
include progress
include stepper
include text_input
include dropdown
include tooltip
include modal
include scroll
include tabs
include collapsible
